# Murf Falcon voices

For every Murf synthesis, test, demo, default, and code change:

- Use the Falcon model only (`falcon-2`). Never use Gen2 or any Gen2 voice.
- Never use Natalie.
- When the target locale is on the Falcon recommended list, use only a voice from that row: https://murf.ai/falcon-2/voices
- When the locale is not on that list, call the Falcon list-voices endpoint and use a voice it returns for that locale. Do not ask first.
  - `GET https://api.murf.ai/v1/speech/voices?model=falcon-2`
  - From this repo: `python3 tools/murf_api_playground.py list --model falcon-2`
- Still reject Natalie and any voice that is Gen2, even if the endpoint returns it.
- Never use the list voices endpoint without model=falcon-2 - `GET https://api.murf.ai/v1/speech/voices?model=falcon-2`

